{"id":"n74236-1-7","stage":5,"title":"생산량 · 产量","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n74236-1-7-1","ko":"올해 사과의 생산량은 어떤가요?","zh":"今年的苹果产量怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"올해","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年。","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}},{"text":"사과의","meaning":"苹果","explanation":"사과：苹果；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"사과","audio":"/audio/46fc35121d1a4b332863.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66371","senseId":"1","lemma":"사과","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사과의","audio":"/audio/9f1b6e1e5ead0a355fbb.mp3"}},{"text":"생산량은","meaning":"产量","explanation":"생산량：产量；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"생산량","audio":"/audio/f51704a1c747586d2c20.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74236","senseId":"1","lemma":"생산량","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생산량은","audio":"/audio/b4bed3120f032bbba1c5.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤가요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤가요","audio":"/audio/23fa3a0906f95e00f157.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8a0cd9bb73fb17e9","term":"올해","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3","entryId":"67842","definition":"现在正在度过的这一年。","pronunciation":["올해"]},{"id":"46fc35121d1a4b33","term":"사과","zh":"苹果","audio":"/audio/46fc35121d1a4b332863.mp3","entryId":"66371","definition":"圆而红、味道酸甜的水果。","pronunciation":["사과"]},{"id":"f51704a1c747586d","term":"생산량","zh":"产量","audio":"/audio/f51704a1c747586d2c20.mp3","entryId":"74236","definition":"在一定时间内生产出的某物品的数量。","pronunciation":["생산냥"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다